@startuml
title 1번 슬라이드. 왜 Gateway에서 WebFlux를 썼는가

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #CBD5E1
  FontColor #0F172A
  RoundCorner 18
}

skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #93C5FD
  FontColor #1E3A8A
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Spring Cloud Gateway\nspring-cloud-starter-gateway" as SCG #DBEAFE
rectangle "WebFlux + Mono/Flux\n비동기 요청 오케스트레이션" as WebFlux #FEF3C7
rectangle "WebClient 기반 fan-out / fan-in\nCatalogBffService\nCommerceReadBffService\nBusinessProductMediaBffService" as WebClientBff #FDE68A
rectangle "Reactive Security / WebFilter\nGatewaySessionCookieAuthenticationWebFilter\nSessionHeaderRelayGlobalFilter" as ReactiveSecurity #DCFCE7
rectangle "Reactive Redis Session\nspring-boot-starter-data-redis-reactive" as ReactiveRedis #F8FAFC
rectangle "WebSocket route support\n/ws/chat" as WebSocket #F8FAFC

SCG --> WebFlux
WebFlux --> WebClientBff
WebFlux --> ReactiveSecurity
WebFlux --> ReactiveRedis
WebFlux --> WebSocket

note bottom of WebFlux
Gateway는 여러 downstream 호출을 묶고,
세션/보안 필터와 WebSocket 라우팅까지 처리한다.
이 특성상 요청당 blocking thread 모델보다
reactive 조합이 더 잘 맞는다.
end note

@enduml
